      "entry_uuid": "4357d40e47db4559a6078e9ea4e799d0",
      "query": "Replit klón",
      "answer": "Egy egyszerű, statikus Replit‑szerű online IDE felületet kapsz lent, teljes önálló HTML fájlként, Tailwinddel és a Replit sötét színpalettájához igazított színekkel.[1]\nA tipográfia is közelíti az eredetit (IBM Plex Sans UI‑hoz, monospace editorhoz), de a működés (futtatás, build) itt még nincs bekötve.[1]\n\n Mit tud ez a mini Replit?\n\n Sötét háttér (0F1017, 1A1C25, 23252F), hasonló, mint a Replit alap dark témája.[1]\n Felső globális header Replit‑szerű logóval, keresővel, „Run / Share” gombokkal.[1]\n Bal oldali fájlpanel projekt névvel, „Add file” gombbal és egyszerű fáfa‑makettel.  \n Középső „editor” panel tab sávval és monospace „kódszöveggel”, ami kinézetre emlékeztet a Replit editorra.[1]\n Jobb oldali konzol / shell panel tabokkal, monospace output blokkal.  \n Container query: nagyobb szélességnél 3 oszlop, mobilon a konzol lecsúszik alulra (oszlopos elrendezés).  \n\n Teljes HTML fájl (Tailwind + CSS container query)\n\nhtml\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"hu\" class=\"h-full\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <title>Replit klón – mini online IDE</title>\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CDN (3.x, de a markup Tailwind 4-hez is kompatibilis utility szinten) -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Google Fonts – Replithez hasonló fontkészlet -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link\n      href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\"\n      rel=\"stylesheet\"\n    >\n\n    <style>\n      :root {\n        /* Replit dark téma színeihez közeli paletta */\n        --bg-root: #0f1017;\n        --bg-default: #1a1c25;\n        --bg-higher: #23252f;\n        --border-subtle: #31343f;\n        --border-strong: #3a3d48;\n        --accent-primary: #0079f2;\n        --accent-primary-soft: #004182;\n        --accent-primary-soft2: #0053a6;\n        --text-default: #e6e8ed;\n        --text-dim: #bfc4ca;\n        --text-dimmest: #a2a8b2;\n      }\n\n      html {\n        block-size: 100%;\n      }\n\n      body {\n        block-size: 100%;\n        margin: 0;\n        font-family: \"IBM Plex Sans\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,\n          \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n        background-color: var(--bg-root);\n        color: var(--text-default);\n      }\n\n      /* Editor monospace */\n      .font-code {\n        font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo,\n          Monaco, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n      }\n\n      /* Container query setup a fő IDE shellre */\n      .ide-shell {\n        container-type: inline-size;\n        container-name: ide-shell;\n      }\n\n      /* Desktop: alap layout (három oszlop) – a utility classok definiálják */\n\n      /* Mobil / szűk nézet: konzol lemegy alulra, file‑panel felül marad */\n      @container ide-shell (max-width: 1023px) {\n        .ide-shell {\n          flex-direction: column;\n        }\n\n        .ide-shell-aside-files {\n          inline-size: 100%;\n          block-size: auto;\n          border-inline-end: none;\n          border-block-end: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n        }\n\n        .ide-shell-editor {\n          inline-size: 100%;\n        }\n\n        .ide-shell-aside-console {\n          inline-size: 100%;\n          block-size: 40vh;\n          border-inline-start: none;\n          border-block-start: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);\n        }\n      }\n\n      /* Néhány finomhangoló egyedi stílus logical propertykkel */\n      .tab-pill {\n        padding-inline: 0.5rem;\n        padding-block: 0.25rem;\n        border-radius: 999px;\n      }\n\n      .input-compact {\n        padding-inline: 0.5rem;\n        padding-block: 0.25rem;\n      }\n\n      .scroll-thin {\n        scrollbar-width: thin;\n      }\n\n      .scroll-thin::-webkit-scrollbar {\n        inline-size: 6px;\n      }\n\n      .scroll-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n        background: transparent;\n      }\n\n      .scroll-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n        background: #31343f;\n        border-radius: 999px;\n      }\n\n      .scroll-thin::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n        background: #444752;\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body class=\"h-full\">\n    <div class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[var(--bg-root)] text-[var(--text-default)]\">\n      <!-- Felső globális nav -->\n      <header\n        class=\"h-12 flex items-center justify-between bg-[var(--bg-default)] border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-3\"\n      >\n        <!-- Bal: logo + project váltó -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <div\n              class=\"inline-flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[var(--accent-primary-soft)] text-xs font-semibold\"\n            >\n              ▶\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight\">Replit klón</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div\n            class=\"hidden md:inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-[var(--bg-higher)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-2 py-1 text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--text-dim)]\"\n          >\n            <span class=\"inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\"></span>\n            <span>my-python-app</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Közép: menü / tabok -->\n        <nav class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-[var(--text-dim)]\">\n          <button class=\"tab-pill bg-[var(--bg-higher)] text-[var(--text-default)]\">\n            Code\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)]\">Console</button>\n          <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)]\">Output</button>\n          <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)]\">Packages</button>\n          <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)]\">Secrets</button>\n        </nav>\n\n        <!-- Jobb: kereső + gombok -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n          <div\n            class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-[var(--bg-higher)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--text-dimmest)]\"\n          >\n            <svg\n              xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n              class=\"ms-2 size-3.5 opacity-70\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n            >\n              <circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"6\" />\n              <line x1=\"16\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"21\" />\n            </svg>\n            <input\n              class=\"bg-transparent border-none outline-none input-compact placeholder:text-[var(--text-dimmest)]\"\n              placeholder=\"Search files or commands\"\n              type=\"text\"\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          <button\n            class=\"hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:bg-sky-500 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-white\"\n          >\n            <span class=\"inline-flex size-3.5 items-center justify-center rounded-[2px] bg-black/20\">\n              ▶\n            </span>\n            Run\n          </button>\n\n          <button\n            class=\"hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-[var(--bg-higher)] hover:bg-slate-800 border border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--text-dim)]\"\n          >\n            Share\n          </button>\n\n          <button\n            class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--bg-higher)] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] size-7 text-[0.7rem] font-medium\"\n          >\n            SY\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- Fő IDE shell: file tree + editor + console -->\n      <main class=\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden ide-shell\">\n        <!-- Fájl panel (bal) -->\n        <aside\n          class=\"ide-shell-aside-files w-60 shrink-0 bg-[var(--bg-root)] border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex flex-col\"\n        >\n          <!-- Felső sáv: projekt + akciók -->\n          <div class=\"h-10 flex items-center justify-between px-3 border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)]\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n              <span class=\"text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--text-dimmest)] uppercase tracking-[0.08em]\">\n                Files\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--text-default)]\">my-python-app</span>\n            </div>\n            <button\n              class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[var(--bg-higher)] hover:bg-slate-800 border border-[var(--border-subtle)] size-6 text-[0.7rem]\"\n              title=\"New file\"\n            >\n              +\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Fáfa -->\n          <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-auto scroll-thin text-[0.8rem] py-2\">\n            <ul class=\"space-y-1 px-2\">\n              <li class=\"text-[var(--text-dimmest)] mb-1\">.</li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs\">📁</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[var(--text-dim)]\">.config</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs\">📁</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[var(--text-dim)]\">venv</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs\">📄</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[var(--text-default)]\">main.py</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs opacity-70\">📄</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[var(--text-dim)]\">requirements.txt</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs opacity-70\">📄</span>\n                <span class=\"text-[var(--text-dim)]\">README.md</span>\n              </li>\n\n              <li class=\"mt-2 text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[var(--text-dimmest)]\">\n                Tools\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[var(--text-dim)]\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs\">⚙️</span>\n                <span>Packages</span>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[var(--text-dim)]\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-xs\">🔑</span>\n                <span>Secrets</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- Editor közép panel -->\n        <section class=\"ide-shell-editor flex-1 flex flex-col bg-[var(--bg-default)]\">\n          <!-- Tab bar -->\n          <div\n            class=\"h-9 flex items-end bg-[var(--bg-higher)] border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-2 gap-1 text-[0.75rem]\"\n          >\n            <button\n              class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 border-t border-x border-[var(--border-strong)] border-b-0 rounded-t-md bg-[var(--bg-default)] px-2 py-1\"\n            >\n              <span class=\"inline-block size-3 text-[0.7rem]\">🐍</span>\n              <span>main.py</span>\n            </button>\n            <button\n              class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-t-md px-2 py-1 text-[var(--text-dim)] hover:bg-slate-800/60\"\n            >\n              <span>README.md</span>\n            </button>\n            <button\n              class=\"ms-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md px-2 py-1 text-[var(--text-dimmest)] hover:bg-slate-800/60\"\n            >\n              <span>⋯</span>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Editor tartalom -->\n          <div class=\"flex-1 relative overflow-hidden bg-[var(--bg-root)]\">\n            <!-- Sor szám + kód (statikus, demo) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex\">\n              <!-- Gutter -->\n              <div\n                class=\"w-10 shrink-0 border-r border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-root)]/95 text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--text-dimmest)] pt-2 px-1 font-code leading-relaxed select-none\"\n              >\n                <div>1</div>\n                <div>2</div>\n                <div>3</div>\n                <div>4</div>\n                <div>5</div>\n                <div>6</div>\n                <div>7</div>\n                <div>8</div>\n                <div>9</div>\n                <div>10</div>\n              </div>\n\n              <!-- Kód blokk -->\n              <div\n                class=\"flex-1 overflow-auto scroll-thin font-code text-[0.8rem] leading-relaxed text-slate-100/90 pt-2 ps-3 pe-4\"\n              >\n                <pre class=\"whitespace-pre\">\n<span class=\"text-emerald-400\"># Egyszerű Replit-szerű editor demo</span>\n<span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">from</span> <span class=\"text-sky-300\">fastapi</span> <span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">import</span> FastAPI\n<span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">from</span> <span class=\"text-sky-300\">pydantic</span> <span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">import</span> BaseModel\n\napp <span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">=</span> FastAPI()\n\n\n<span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">class</span> <span class=\"text-amber-300\">Message</span>(BaseModel):\n    text: <span class=\"text-sky-300\">str</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"text-emerald-400\">@app.get</span>(<span class=\"text-lime-300\">\"/\"</span>)\n<span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">async def</span> <span class=\"text-amber-300\">root</span>():\n    <span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">return</span> {<span class=\"text-lime-300\">\"hello\"</span>: <span class=\"text-lime-300\">\"Replit klónból 👋\"</span>}\n\n\n<span class=\"text-emerald-400\">@app.post</span>(<span class=\"text-lime-300\">\"/echo\"</span>)\n<span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">async def</span> <span class=\"text-amber-300\">echo</span>(payload: Message):\n    <span class=\"text-fuchsia-400\">return</span> {<span class=\"text-lime-300\">\"you_said\"</span>: payload.text}\n                </pre>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Alsó status bar -->\n          <footer\n            class=\"h-7 flex items-center justify-between bg-[var(--bg-root)] border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-3 text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--text-dimmest)]\"\n          >\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n              <span>Spaces: 4</span>\n              <span>UTF‑8</span>\n              <span>LF</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n              <span>Python 3.11</span>\n              <span>Ln 4, Col 11</span>\n            </div>\n          </footer>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Jobb oldali konzol / output -->\n        <aside\n          class=\"ide-shell-aside-console w-80 shrink-0 bg-[var(--bg-root)] border-l border-[var(--border-subtle)] flex flex-col\"\n        >\n          <!-- Tab bar a konzolhoz -->\n          <div\n            class=\"h-9 flex items-center gap-1 px-2 border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-default)] text-[0.75rem]\"\n          >\n            <button\n              class=\"tab-pill bg-[var(--bg-higher)] text-[var(--text-default)]\"\n            >\n              Console\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)] text-[var(--text-dim)]\">\n              Shell\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"tab-pill hover:bg-[var(--bg-higher)] text-[var(--text-dim)]\">\n              Output\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Konzol tartalom -->\n          <div class=\"flex-1 overflow-auto scroll-thin font-code text-[0.75rem] bg-[var(--bg-root)] px-3 py-2\">\n            <div class=\"text-emerald-400\">\n              ▶ Running <span class=\"text-slate-200\">python main.py</span>...\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-1 text-slate-100\">\n              Uvicorn running on <span class=\"text-sky-300\">http://0.0.0.0:8000</span> (Press CTRL+C to quit)\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-2 text-slate-200\">\n              GET <span class=\"text-sky-300\">/</span> <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">200 OK</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-2 text-slate-200\">\n              POST <span class=\"text-sky-300\">/echo</span> <span class=\"text-emerald-400\">200 OK</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-slate-400\">\n              &gt;&gt;&gt; <span class=\"text-slate-200\"># Ide jöhetne egy interaktív REPL...</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Konzol alja: mini input / státusz -->\n          <div\n            class=\"h-8 flex items-center justify-between bg-[var(--bg-default)] border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] px-2 text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--text-dimmest)]\"\n          >\n            <span>Console ready</span>\n            <span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">CPU 3% • RAM 120 MB</span>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n      </main>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n\n Hogyan tovább építhető?\n\n Ha valódi szerkesztőt akarsz, cseréld a statikus <pre> blokkot Monaco Editorra vagy CodeMirrorra, és kösd be JavaScriptből a konténer divbe.[1]\n A „Run” gombot összedrótozhatod egy backend API‑val (pl. FastAPI, Node), ami Dockerben vagy sandboxban futtatja a kódot, és a válaszát a jobb oldali konzol panelre írod ki.  \n Ha szinte 1:1 Replit kinézet kell, a fenti változókat (színek, kerekítések, árnyékok) finomhangolhatod az általad mentett eredeti index.html‑ből kimásolt konkrét értékekre.[1]",
